# CineScope Environment Variables
#
# NOTE: CineScope is a 100% frontend-only application.
# All core features (search, deep catalog, collections, moods, filters, watchlist, viewing history)
# work immediately out of the box with ZERO configuration or external API keys needed.
#
# Optional: TMDB Client Enhancement Key
# Any variable starting with VITE_ is bundled into client-side JavaScript and is visible to the public.
# Never place secret server keys here.
# VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=your_optional_tmdb_api_key_here
